<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Jan broad money M3 up 22.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Jan broad money M3 up 22.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's broad money M3 expanded by 22.1 percent year-on-year in January against 22.7 percent growth in December, the central bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Total annual loans growth stood at 28.8 percent at the end of January from 26.7 percent at the end of December, it said.  </p>
<p>		   MALAYSIA MONETARY AGGREGATES:</p>
<p>(Percentage change at end of period, year-on-year)</p>
<p>	     Jan 97	Dec 96	Jan 96</p>
<p>  M1	  23.3	  18.3	  10.7</p>
<p>  M2	  21.4	  20.9	  25.1</p>
<p>  M3	  22.1	  22.7	  24.3</p>
<p>Note: M1 - money in circulation and cash on deposit in banks</p>
<p>	 M2 - M1 plus time, savings and foreign currency deposits</p>
<p>	 M3 - broad money</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
